type: software
title: "CLIMB: Cryptographic Ladder Impact Measurement Benchmark"
abstract: "A reproducible benchmark suite measuring the operational cost of Merkle Tree Ladder (MTL) mode applied to post-quantum DNSSEC signing (SLH-DSA), compared against signing without MTL amortization."
